    "at_cmp_insight": { zh: "在同一646车系完整年度样本上逐步增加信息；悬停可查看五折标准差、年度截面WMAPE与特征数。年度截面WMAPE用于模块内误差评估，与月度预测指标分别报告。", en: "Information is added step by step on the same 646-series complete-year cohort; hover to see fold standard deviation, annual cross-sectional WMAPE, and feature count. Annual cross-sectional WMAPE is a within-module error metric reported separately from monthly forecasting." },
