    "at_boundary_missing_note": { zh: "部分高排名特征代表配置字段缺失，提示数据完整度本身包含市场分层信息。", en: "Some high-ranking features represent missing specification fields, showing that data completeness itself carries market-segmentation information." },
    "at_method_summary": { zh: "查看模型与数据来源", en: "Model and Data Sources" },
    "at_method_note": { zh: "目标为年度销量的log1p变换；XGBoost采用按车系分组的五折GroupKFold。预处理在训练折内拟合，特征重要性采用XGBoost gain。", en: "The target is log1p annual sales. XGBoost uses five-fold GroupKFold by series, with preprocessing fitted within each training fold. Feature importance uses XGBoost gain." },
